"Inafanya kazi bila mtandao","Prove your farm":"Thibitisha shamba lako","Understand your profit":"Elewa faida yako","Type or speak a sentence. Papa fills in the entry and you tap save. Crops, sprays, animals, workers and money, all in one book.":"Andika au sema sentensi moja. Papa anajaza rekodi nawe unabonyeza hifadhi. Mazao, dawa, mifugo, wafanyakazi na pesa, vyote kwenye daftari moja.","Everything is saved on your phone first. When you are back online it uploads by itself, and nothing is lost.":"Kila kitu huhifadhiwa kwenye simu yako kwanza. Ukirudi mtandaoni hupakiwa chenyewe, na hakuna kinachopotea.","Get a Farm ID and an export passport. Buyers scan the QR code to check your licences, plots and spray record.":"Pata Kitambulisho cha Shamba na pasipoti ya mauzo nje. Wanunuzi hukagua leseni, viwanja na dawa kwa kuchanganua msimbo wa QR.","Cost per bag, per bird, per hectare. Break-even, loans and what-if. Clear numbers, plain words.":'Gharama kwa gunia, kwa kuku, kwa hekta. Hatua ya kutopata hasara, mikopo na "itakuwaje kama". Namba wazi, maneno rahisi.',"A unique Farmer ID and Farm ID":"Kitambulisho cha kipekee cha Mkulima na Shamba","Licences with expiry warnings before they lapse":"Leseni zenye onyo kabla hazijaisha","Plot GPS and boundaries":"GPS ya kiwanja na mipaka","A spray log that shows no early harvests":"Kumbukumbu ya dawa inayoonyesha hakuna mavuno ya mapema","Export passport":"Pasipoti ya mauzo nje",Genuine:"Halisi","Scan to verify":"Changanua kuthibitisha","Even one sale or expense is enough.":"Hata mauzo au gharama moja inatosha.","A reminder that knows your name.":"Kikumbusho kinachojua jina lako.","Ready to start your book?":"Tayari kuanza daftari lako?","It takes a minute. Papa Ledger will show you around.":"Inachukua dakika moja. Papa Ledger atakuonyesha.","Papa Ledger is putting your first page together.":"Papa Ledger anaandaa ukurasa wako wa kwanza.","Open my book":"Fungua daftari langu","Choose a crop or herd…":"Chagua zao au mifugo…",Result